  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.4.2-beta.1`\n\n### Features\n\n- implement ZMODEM protocol support with real interop tests ([1d715654](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/1d715654716d7571fbe94ee093123dfb01da2ed6))\n- add SSH agent forwarding support and update related UI components ([f9793f28](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/f9793f287265a8fd94198e16c79c2ef094fc499d))\n- implement SSH agent authentication support and update related UI components ([e734789c](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/e734789c1a6301e014a5ea7a6eb53955b231354d))\n- add bulk profile deletion functionality and update i18n for selection actions ([dbb3c0b9](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/dbb3c0b9d6cf84b81c0b3c2f50b618da900d471f))\n\n### Fixes\n\n- fix i18n support for various UI components and error messages ([c674acae](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/c674acae77f9af87a04c1649f55c028ba96fea9e))\n\n### Performance\n\n- improve code readability by formatting conditional rendering and toast title ([893bdf8a](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/893bdf8ade7a837220aa409c9094b80a25306946))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.4.2-beta.1...v0.4.2-beta.2](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.4.2-beta.1...v0.4.2-beta.2)\n",
